    D -->|"paragraph or transcript-turn blocks"| F["<b>Optional transcript mapping</b><br/>What: when the registered profile is transcript, retain supplied timestamps and Unicode speaker names<br/>Component: deterministic turn parser<br/>Script: app/extraction/text.py"]
